{"id":"me_0246","question":"Many people remember Napoleon Bonaparte being exceptionally short.\nWhat was Napoleon's actual height?","answer":"About 5 feet 7 inches (1.70 m) — average for his era","answer_note":"Napoleon was about 5'7\", average for a French man of his time. The 'short Napoleon' myth partly came from British propaganda and a confusion between French and English inches.","hook":"The myth of the little general — completely false..."},
